      "Gameplay talks to worlds through the World interface (groundAt, collisions, zones)",
      "Cube World props load only when external assets exist; otherwise built-in models"
    ] },
    { "dot": "amber", "title": "Rendering stack", "items": [
      "src/scene is a mini three.js: geometry, materials, glTF (cgltf + meshopt)",
      "Renderer: PCF shadows, ≤16 point lights, fog, MSAA → pixel 2× → tilt-shift/grade",
      "HUD draws Canvas2D (CoreText, Thai + emoji) textures as overlay quads"
    ] },
